# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS -- nothing here may EVER enter git history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `standalone/env` (no dot) held a live Telegram bot token and the Supabase
# password in plaintext. Rotate those credentials, then delete the file. Until
# it is deleted this rule is the only thing keeping it out of history, and
# history is forever.
env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
device.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large binaries -- shipped to the fleet by deploy/push-models.sh, not by git.
# TensorRT engines are not portable across GPU architecture or JetPack version,
# so they are BUILT PER FLEET on a reference box rather than version-controlled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/
*.engine
*.plan
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
sounds/
*.mp3
*.wav

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state -- per-device, lives in /var/lib/deerkha on a real box.
# Committing these would make the "one identical artifact" guarantee false.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
config_cache.json
config_cache.json.tmp
cleanup_config.json
.cleanup.lock
logs/
*.log
events.jsonl
*.faulthandler
video_storage/
reference_frames/

# Legacy: superseded by server-delivered ignore zones, no longer read.
roi_zones.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
ds_env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browser "Save page as, complete" copies of the deployment guide. The guide
# itself is versioned at docs/deployment-guide.html; these carry a _files/
# directory of downloaded frames and scripts and would drift silently.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*_files/
Deerkha Drishti *.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
